  "label": "Welfare Dependency Tropes",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the stereotype that Black people are 'welfare dependent' or lazy, which is a harmful racialized trope used to justify systemic neglect or criticism of Black communities' economic circumstances. This trope is central to the meme's framing of the child as a symbol of poverty and the woman as a privileged outsider.",
